# {{projectName}}

Web Automation Framework using Go, Playwright, and Testify.

## 🚀 Features
- **Language**: Go (Golang)
- **Browser Automation**: [Playwright Go](https://github.com/playwright-community/playwright-go)
- **Assertions**: [Testify](https://github.com/stretchr/testify)
- **Pattern**: Page Object Model (POM)

## 🛠️ Setup
1. Install Go (v1.21+)
2. Install dependencies:
```bash
go mod download
go run github.com/playwright-community/playwright-go/cmd/playwright@v0.5101.0 install --with-deps
```

## 🏃‍♂️ Running Tests
```bash
go test ./tests/... -v
```